                        Patch Metadata - Gen 21/100 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ improved_shared_ring_hub_crz_ansatz                                                       │
│ patch_description        │ Redesign the ANSATZ_SPEC inside the EVOLVE-BLOCK to improve generalization and validation │
│                          │ performance by increasing parameter sharing and stabilizing training. The new structure   │
│                          │ keeps the same overall data flow and measurement scheme, but:                             │
│                          │ - Adds a ring CZ entanglement on the outer qubits (perimeter) for richer passband         │
│                          │ connectivity.                                                                             │
│                          │ - Introduces a ring CRX entanglement on the same perimeter using a single shared          │
│                          │ parameter (crx_ring) for parameter efficiency.                                            │
│                          │ - Replaces hub-to-center entanglement from CRY to CRZ with a single shared parameter      │
│                          │ (crz_hub_edge) across all hub edges, improving stability.                                 │
│                          │ - Maintains pre/post RZ layers and RY layers with symmetry-based parameter sharing.       │
│                          │ - Keeps the per-block, per-upload/repetition parameter copies as required by the original │
│                          │ design and preserves all inputs/outputs.                                                  │
