│ patch_description        │ A symmetry-conscious evolution of the ansatz that adds a center-to-edge hub with three    │
│                          │ shared parameter families (CRX, CRY, CRZ) in addition to an outer-ring CRX entanglement.  │
│                          │ This design preserves the data-uploading structure and depth constraints, but increases   │
│                          │ expressive power and parameter efficiency by reusing a small set of hub parameters across │
│                          │ all four edge connections. It aims to improve validation/test performance and reduce      │
│                          │ overfitting by introducing diverse center-edge interactions (via CRX/CRY/CRZ) while       │
│                          │ keeping the same inputs/outputs and connectivity constraints.                             │
