│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ add_cry_ring_after_crx_ring                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ Introduce a CRY ring entanglement on the same outer perimeter as the existing CRX ring.   │
│                          │ This adds richer inter-qubit correlations by interleaving controlled-Y rotations around   │
│                          │ the ring, using a shared parameter "cry_ring" for all eight edges. This augments the      │
│                          │ entanglement motif without drastically increasing circuit depth, potentially improving    │
│                          │ expressivity and generalization. Parameter sharing keeps the parameter count modest (one  │
│                          │ additional parameter key per block), resulting in 78 total parameters (up from 72) and a  │
│                          │ slightly deeper but more powerful ring structure.                                         │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
