│ patch_description        │ Introduce per-upload deltas to the ring entanglement by replacing the perimeter CZ gates  │
│                          │ with a pair of CRX gates per edge: a shared base CRX gate and a per-block delta CRX gate. │
│                          │ This leverages additive gate composition (CRX(base) followed by CRX(delta) on the same    │
│                          │ wires yields a net rotation of base + delta) to provide modest but expressive per-upload  │
│                          │ flexibility without exploding parameter count. The base parameter (crx_ring_base) is      │
│                          │ shared across all blocks, while crx_ring_delta provides upload-specific adjustments. This │
│                          │ changes only ANSATZ_SPEC and increases N_PARAMS_PER_BLOCK by 2 (crx_ring_base and         │
│                          │ crx_ring_delta), scaling N_PARAMS accordingly. The approach follows the suggested         │
│                          │ delta-parameter technique for improved expressivity with controlled parameter growth.     │
