│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ delta-ry-base-delta-upload                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ This rewrite introduces a base + per-upload deltas scheme for RY rotations, aligned with  │
│                          │ tic-tac-toe symmetry groups (corner, edge, center). Each group shares a base angle, while │
│                          │ three per-upload delta parameters refine the rotation for that upload. The approach       │
│                          │ increases expressivity without altering the fixed training loop, data construction, or    │
│                          │ feature map. It preserves parameter efficiency by sharing keys across wires within a      │
│                          │ group and using per-upload deltas to boost representational power without deepening the   │
│                          │ circuit. The rest of the circuit (CRY ring, CRX hub, and post-RZ blocks) remains shared   │
│                          │ per group to maintain budget. The implementation is fully contained within the            │
│                          │ EVOLVE-BLOCK, and ANSATZ_SPEC is built accordingly to enable gradient-based training with │
│                          │ Adam.                                                                                     │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
