│                          │ strong parameter sharing. Key changes:                                                    │
│                          │ - Layer 3 uses a ring of CRX gates around the outer 8 qubits with a single shared         │
│                          │ parameter crx_ring.                                                                       │
│                          │ - Layer 4 implements hub entanglement from the center qubit to each edge using CRZ and    │
