│                          │ original design.                                                                          │
│                          │ This design reduces parameter count while preserving expressive connectivity, aiming to   │
│                          │ improve validation/test metrics and generalization without altering the fixed data        │
│                          │ generation, feature map, uploads/repeats, or training loop.                               │
