│ patch_description        │ Swap the entanglement motif to use CRX gates on the outer ring and CRY gates for hub      │
│                          │ (center-to-edge) entanglement. This mirrors the empirically stronger configuration from   │
│                          │ prior results by exchanging ring and hub gate types while preserving parameter sharing: a │
│                          │ single shared param for the ring (crx_ring) across the 8 ring edges and a single shared   │
│                          │ param for the hub (cry_hub_edge) across the 4 center-to-edge connections. This preserves  │
│                          │ total parameter count per block (11) and keeps adjacency constraints intact, with         │
│                          │ potential to improve validation/test performance and reduce gap.                          │
