│ patch_description        │ Building on the hierarchical, symmetry-based design, this version increases expressivity  │
│                          │ by relocating the ring entanglement to a parameterized CRX ring and introducing per-edge  │
│                          │ CRY hub entanglement gates with distinct parameters. This adds targeted, edge-specific    │
│                          │ rotation angles to center-to-edge connections while preserving symmetry-driven parameter  │
│                          │ sharing for the pre/post RZ and center/edge/corner groups. The changes aim to improve     │
│                          │ validation/generalization while keeping the overall architecture compatible with the      │
│                          │ fixed training loop, data encoding, and data-uploading scheme. The rest of the pipeline   │
│                          │ (data, feature map, uploads, repeats, and Adam training) remains unchanged.               │
