                        Patch Metadata - Gen 61/100 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ tie_pre_post_rz_params                                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ The current program has 78 parameters (split into 6 per block × 3 uploads × 2 repeats),   │
│                          │ while the better-performing prior programs had 60-66 parameters with superior validation  │
│                          │ accuracy (0.60-0.65 vs 0.53).                                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The key insight from the recommendations and prior successful programs is to apply        │
│                          │ **parameter sharing across pre- and post-entanglement RZ rotations**. Instead of          │
│                          │ maintaining separate `rz_pre_corner`, `rz_pre_edge`, `rz_pre_center` and                  │
│                          │ `rz_post_corner`, `rz_post_edge`, `rz_post_center` (6 keys), we consolidate these into    │
│                          │ just 3 shared parameters: `rz_corner`, `rz_edge`, `rz_center`.                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This reduces N_PARAMS_PER_BLOCK from 6 to 3, yielding:                                    │
│                          │ - New N_PARAMS: 3 × 3 uploads × 2 repeats = 18 (vs current 78)                            │
│                          │ - Circuit maintains the same depth and gate structure                                     │
│                          │ - Reduced parameter count improves generalization and matches the recipe of prior         │
│                          │ high-scoring programs                                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **Motivation:**                                                                           │
│                          │ - The seed program (0.60 score) used this exact sharing strategy                          │
│                          │ - Halving the RZ parameters encourages the optimizer to find a more compact solution      │
│                          │ - The validation accuracy plateau in the current program suggests overfitting; fewer      │
│                          │ parameters should help                                                                    │
│                          │ - Prior results show that 60 parameters is a sweet spot for this task                     │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0376                                                                                   │
