│ patch_description        │ A completely restructured, symmetry-aware ansatz that replaces the ring CZ entangler with │
│                          │ a single-parameter CRX ring over the outer tic-tac-toe ring and a hub entangler using CRY │
│                          │ gates from center to edge qubits. This design increases parameter efficiency while        │
│                          │ boosting expressive power by leveraging a ring-based rotationally symmetric entangler     │
│                          │ (CRX_ring) and a compact hub-connector (CRY_hub_edge). It preserves the same              │
│                          │ inputs/outputs and overall training loop, but uses a different, potentially more          │
│                          │ expressive parameter-sharing scheme to improve validation accuracy and reduce train-test  │
│                          │ gaps.                                                                                     │
