│ patch_description        │ Introduce a center-edge CRZ layer to replace the center-post RZ gate. This adds           │
│                          │ center-to-edge CRZ gates that share a single parameter, replacing rz_post_center with     │
│                          │ crz_center_edge gates, thereby enriching center-edge correlations without increasing      │
│                          │ parameter count. The change preserves adjacent CZ connectivity and parameter-sharing      │
│                          │ philosophy, and keeps overall block structure intact. This approach aligns with the       │
│                          │ suggested center-edge CRZ augmentation to improve expressivity and validation             │
│                          │ performance.                                                                              │
